  - kind: 0
    speaker: 
    speakerEntityId: 
    text: Traveller! The Drowned Bell has been silent since the flood took the old
      belfry.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    condition: {fileID: 0}
    actions: {fileID: 0}
    options: []
  - kind: 3
    speaker: 
    speakerEntityId: 
    text: 
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    condition: {fileID: 0}
    actions: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 88ad7492e109d8e92b568b9d4ce3a92d, type: 2}
    options: []
  - kind: 1
    speaker: 
    speakerEntityId: 
    text: Will you help us?
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    condition: {fileID: 0}
    actions: {fileID: 0}
    options:
    - text: I'll find the clapper and ring it.
      condition: {fileID: 0}
      hideWhenUnavailable: 0
    - text: Why should I help?
      condition: {fileID: 0}
      hideWhenUnavailable: 0
  - kind: 3
    speaker: 
    speakerEntityId: 
    text: 
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    condition: {fileID: 0}
    actions: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0dec731b43bfcc1148ebf294dc77ff1c, type: 2}
    options: []
  - kind: 0
    speaker: 
    speakerEntityId: 
    text: Bless you. Odd keeps the marsh gate key, and he will want coin for it.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    condition: {fileID: 0}
    actions: {fileID: 0}
    options: []
  - kind: 0
    speaker: 
    speakerEntityId: 
    text: Because the marsh will not let anyone rest until that bell rings again.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    condition: {fileID: 0}
    actions: {fileID: 0}
    options: []
  - kind: 0
    speaker: 
    speakerEntityId: 
    text: You rang it! Hollowmere can sleep again. Take my lantern, you have earned
      it.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    condition: {fileID: 0}
    actions: {fileID: 0}
    options: []
